# Agent Crew patch 0001: the daemon always requires its password, and agents can never sign in to it.
# - No password configured: every WebSocket session and protected HTTP route is refused (upstream admits everyone as owner).
# - The local-credential file login is removed: upstream writes ~/.paseo/local-credential on every start, and any
#   process running as the user, the agents included, could read it and get owner access (and approve its own actions).
# - PASEO_PASSWORD is stripped from the environment of agent processes.
# Modified by Agent Crew (Apache-2.0 section 4b).

